{"Title":"Proposal for a legislative amendment to the Constitution to require reappointment of judges every 5 years","BillNumber":"H37","DocketNumber":"HD1570","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"O_R1","Name":"Orlando Ramos","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/O_R1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T15:41:13.653"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"O_R1","Name":"Orlando Ramos","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/O_R1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T15:41:13.6533333"},{"Id":"C_G1","Name":"Carlos González","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/C_G1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T15:41:13.8866667"},{"Id":"MMD1","Name":"Michelle M. DuBois","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MMD1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-13T14:44:05.8266667"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"C_G1","Name":"Carlos González","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/C_G1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T15:41:13.653"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H37/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Proposal for Constitutional Amendment","Pinslip":"By Representatives Ramos of Springfield and González of Springfield, a petition (accompanied by proposal for constitutional amendment, House, No. 37) of Orlando Ramos and Carlos González for a legislative amendment to the Constitution to require reappointment of judges every five years.  The Judiciary.","DocumentText":"\tArticle I of chapter III of Part the Second of the Constitution is hereby amended by striking out the words “during good behavior” and inserting place thereof the following words:- for 5 years and shall be eligible for reappointment by the governor, with consent of the council.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Adverse","Fisca